A.l7Q=new B.av(["there is / there are (to exist)","\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059 for things and events, \u3044\u307e\u3059 for people and animals \xb7 \u4f1a\u8b70\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059, \u732b\u304c\u3044\u307e\u3059",'English just says "there is" for everything, but Japanese picks \u3044\u307e\u3059 for people and animals (things that move on their own) and \u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059 for the rest.',"We had a lot of meetings.","had"])
