A.l8q=new B.av(["might end up (doing) (something bad)","verb stem (without \u307e\u3059) + \u304b\u306d\u306a\u3044 \xb7 \u8d77\u3053\u3057\u307e\u3059 \u2192 \u8d77\u3053\u3057\u304b\u306d\u306a\u3044","Use it only when you're worried something bad could happen. The look-alike form with \u307e\u3059 instead means it's hard for you to do something.","If you rush like that, you could end up causing an accident.","could end up"])
