A.l8F=new B.av(["I heard that / they say that","plain-form sentence + \u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059 \xb7 \u4e2d\u6b62\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059",'Use it to pass along something you heard. It sounds a bit more formal than the usual "I heard" pattern.',"I heard tomorrow's game is canceled.","I heard"])
A.l90=new B.av(["can't help but (do)","plain negative verb with \u306a\u3044 dropped + \u305a\u306b\u306f\u3044\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044; \u3059\u308b becomes \u305b\u305a\u306b\u306f \xb7 \u7b11\u308f\u305a\u306b\u306f\u3044\u3089\u308c\u306a\u3044","Use it when you try to hold back but just can't.","I couldn't help laughing when I heard that story.","couldn't help"])
